@startuml getHttpClientUuidExcludingOldReleaseAndNewRelease
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getHttpClientUuidExcludingOldReleaseAndNewRelease – Retrieve HTTP Client UUID (Excluding Old/New Release)
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "HTTP Client Interface" as hci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - applicationName
  - releaseNumber (old release)
  - newReleaseForwardingName (new release)
end note

requestor -> hci: (applicationName, releaseNumber, newReleaseForwardingName)
activate hci

hci -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> hci: HTTP client List
deactivate jd

note over hci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Filter out interfaces with old releaseNumber or newReleaseForwardingName  
  - Compare application-name  
  - Return eligible HTTP client UUID if found  
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

hci --> requestor: httpClientUuid | undefined
deactivate hci

@enduml
